      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COME ON LARRY (2) steps out for the first time at this course. Comes here a last start placegetter at Ballarat in a Grade 4/5 (31.31). Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Makes plenty of appeal. MIGHTY ALAN (1) hit the ground running with a slick early sectional but ran over late and missed the frame when a 4 length fourth (27.99) over 484m at this track. Key player if finds best. ROMAIKA (4) is progressing well with another good run last time, placing (23.56) from Box 1 at this track. Has a solid record from this box including two wins and a minor placing. Expected to be in this for a long way. HE PLAYED ONE (7) cannot be left out after placing here at this trip last start.",
